  "steps": [
    "Grind the coconut and poppy seeds with a little water into a smooth paste.",
    "Heat the oil, add the cloves, cinnamon and curry leaves, then the onions and green chillies and cook until golden.",
    "Add the ginger garlic paste and cook for a minute, then add the tomatoes with the chilli powder, coriander powder, turmeric and salt and cook until the oil separates.",
    "Add the chicken and sear on high heat for 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the coconut paste and water, cover and simmer for 20 minutes until the chicken is tender.",
    "Sprinkle the garam masala, simmer uncovered 5 minutes to thicken and finish with the coriander leaves."
  ]
